{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmo Tales is a brand-new take on space combat! Shift dimensions and change reality as a teenage driver in his witty sentient cosmobile. Embark on a fast-paced, dimension-shifting adventure full of whimsical stories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/13006815d11a26d561a74d334143451f.avif?t=1771580755\" alt=\"Shift Dimensions. Change Everything.\" width=620 height=105 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just speeding through space\u2014you\u2019re\u00a0rewiring it. Shift between alternate versions of reality in an instant; escape ambushes, solve environmental puzzles, or turn the tide of otherwise impossible combat. Every dimension has its own rules, visuals, weapons, enemy interactions, and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/977a56eaac40a5b2fe4fda60cd1d44c8.poster.avif?t=1771580755\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/977a56eaac40a5b2fe4fda60cd1d44c8.webm?t=1771580755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/977a56eaac40a5b2fe4fda60cd1d44c8.mp4?t=1771580755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/4913a8cf53c03a10679921308a929831.avif?t=1771580755\" alt=\"Cosmic Combat with a Twist\" width=618 height=71 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast, strafe, and barrel roll your way through enemy swarms, jet formations, colossal bosses, and enormous motherships. Use\u00a0weapons,\u00a0gadgets, and the environment to your advantage across multiple realities and choose your own unique approach to each mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/7298ceaf07383026d975c8a9828e755f.poster.avif?t=1771580755\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/7298ceaf07383026d975c8a9828e755f.webm?t=1771580755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/7298ceaf07383026d975c8a9828e755f.mp4?t=1771580755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/2c7d9ac8833b9a3c9afb20d5eca500e1.avif?t=1771580755\" alt=\"Handcrafted Visual Style\" width=619 height=75 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outer space as you\u2019ve never known it. Vibrant colors, donut-shaped planets, bright stars, or even deep (rainbow) space. Every universe sector is lovingly crafted with its own comic-book flair, inspired by \u201870s retro sci-fi and modern indie artistry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/ae7ee9ec3cd07eff12042789c902a33d.poster.avif?t=1771580755\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/ae7ee9ec3cd07eff12042789c902a33d.webm?t=1771580755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/ae7ee9ec3cd07eff12042789c902a33d.mp4?t=1771580755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/beaab54bd244a62eb484ec41f7868ee2.avif?t=1771580755\" alt=\"A Hero and His Car\" width=616 height=66 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a teenage driver and his loyal, fully-loaded cosmobile. Your car talks. Your car fights. Your car\u00a0feels. This isn\u2019t just your ride\u2014it\u2019s your best friend in the whole universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/61ee23050bc168d655f5118cf17734ba.poster.avif?t=1771580755\" width=780 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/61ee23050bc168d655f5118cf17734ba.webm?t=1771580755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/61ee23050bc168d655f5118cf17734ba.mp4?t=1771580755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/6fb13ff20dffb40be6c5bc6ae8802bc3.avif?t=1771580755\" alt=\"A Universe Full of Stories\" width=616 height=66 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sector is a self-contained\u00a0comic book episode, complete with characters, conflicts, and dimensional drama. From laugh-out-loud quests to moments of surprising depth,\u00a0<i>Cosmo Tales</i>\u00a0is more than a ride\u2014it\u2019s an adventure you\u2019ll want to experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/a9816b0a2f91812da16fa7e31c627fac.avif?t=1771580755\" alt=\"KEY FEATURES\" width=616 height=69 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant dimension switching</strong> changes gameplay, art, and pretty much everything on the fly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Car space combat</strong> for fast fingers and a sharp brain with multiple dimension-related moves and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Striking handcrafted visuals</strong> blending retro sci-fi with modern indie comic styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bite-sized adventures</strong>\u00a0in the form of unique missions, boss fights, and collectible comic books</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601630?t=1771580755","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/e91401c683d9ac44d16cfc9da103914eb67a5041/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771580755","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/54d8f15e45768d1860387c6be824283a679ed936/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771580755","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/54d8f15e45768d1860387c6be824283a679ed936/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771580755","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmo Tales is a brand-new take on space combat! Shift dimensions and change reality as a teenage driver in his witty sentient cosmobile. Embark on a fast-paced, dimension-shifting adventure full of whimsical stories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/13006815d11a26d561a74d334143451f.avif?t=1771580755\" alt=\"Shif