odern indie comic styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bite-sized adventures</strong>\u00a0in the form of unique missions, boss fights, and collectible comic books</p></li></ul>","developers":["Bohemia Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/cf997399158fa1dda1dc2c009820b7d0d2c0ccba/header.jpg?t=1771580755","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3601630/1138903238/27fd17eddc00f1057752259df94a3f1913591f64/1758266900/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758281954","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3601630/1138903238/27fd17eddc00f1057752259df94a3f1913591f64/1758266900/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758281954","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3601630/1138903238/27fd17eddc00f1057752259df94a3f1913591f64/1758266900/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758281954","id":257201903,"name":"Cosmo Tales Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257201903/e7999785d827c9ff3d230d7c4a94a093787a61ae/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758281954"}],"name":"Cosmo Tales","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 / AMD Ryzen 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060 | AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Hardware requirements are a subject to change during Early Access. SSD Recommended</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</s